{"section":20,"id":"200314","japanese":"…鎧はいやだ。<end>","korean":"…갑옷은 싫어.<end>"}
{"section":20,"id":"200363","japanese":"………渡せん。<end>","korean":"………못 넘겨.<end>"}
{"section":27,"id":"270084","japanese":"準備できている<end>","korean":"준비돼 있다<end>"}
{"section":28,"id":"280003","japanese":"やあ、ヴァン。<end>","korean":"안녕, 반.<end>"}
{"section":28,"id":"280012","japanese":"じゃ、行こう。<end>","korean":"그럼, 가자.<end>"}
{"section":28,"id":"280125","japanese":"よし、行こう！<end>","korean":"좋아, 가자!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310090","japanese":"立ち上がろう！<end>","korean":"일어나자!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310139","japanese":"何をする気だ！<end>","korean":"무슨 짓을 할 셈이야!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310159","japanese":"用意はいいか？<end>","korean":"준비됐나?<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310165","japanese":"気に入らんな。<end>","korean":"마음에 안 드는군.<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310167","japanese":"な、何者だ！！<end>","korean":"누, 누구냐!!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310203","japanese":"ひいいいっ！！<end>","korean":"히이익!!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310218","japanese":"（チャカ…。）<end>","korean":"(차카….)<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310219","japanese":"に、逃げろ！！<end>","korean":"도, 도망쳐!!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310236","japanese":"させるかよ！！<end>","korean":"그렇게 둘 순 없지!!<end>"}
{"section":31,"id":"310276","japanese":"な、なんだ！？<end>","korean":"뭐, 뭐야!?<end>"}
{"section":32,"id":"320068","japanese":"もう大丈夫か？<end>","korean":"이제 괜찮아?<end>"}
{"section":33,"id":"330057","japanese":"なるほど、ね。<end>","korean":"그렇군.<end>"}
{"section":33,"id":"330120","japanese":"待て。危険だ。<end>","korean":"기다려. 위험해.<end>"}
{"section":33,"id":"330147","japanese":"下がるがよい。<end>","korean":"물러나거라.<end>"}
{"section":33,"id":"330153","japanese":"そう、残念ね。<end>","korean":"그래, 아쉽네.<end>"}
{"section":33,"id":"330164","japanese":"…エリス様は？<end>","korean":"…에리스 님은?<end>"}
{"section":34,"id":"340036","japanese":"く…っ、何だ？<end>","korean":"큭… 뭐지?<end>"}
